<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Sumrall: "It ain't fully awake yet" + Carlton Reese on the Gators</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>The postgame press conference, the injury updates and Carlton Reese's column: Florida is a contender now.</mj-preview>
    <mj-font name="Newsreader" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:opsz,wght@6..72,400;6..72,600;6..72,700&amp;display=swap" />
    <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&amp;display=swap" />
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Inter, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#14243D" font-size="16px" line-height="1.55" />
      <mj-button background-color="#FA4616" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0" inner-padding="14px 22px" font-size="13px" font-weight="800" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .gb-wordmark { font-weight:900; letter-spacing:-1.8px; }
      .gb-h1 { font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif; font-size:34px; line-height:1.08; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.5px; }
      .gb-h2 { font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif; font-size:28px; line-height:1.1; font-weight:700; }
      @media only screen and (max-width:480px) {
        .gb-h1 { font-size:28px !important; line-height:1.12 !important; }
        .gb-h2 { font-size:24px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F2F0EB" width="640px">

    <mj-section background-color="#FA4616" padding="10px 24px">
      <mj-column width="70%">
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="13px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="3px" padding="0">FLORIDA 52, OLE MISS 28</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="30%">
        <mj-text align="right" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="11px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" padding="1px 0 0">POSTGAME REACTION</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="16px 24px 12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" padding="0">
          <a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/?utm_source=gatorbait_postgame_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_reaction_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=masthead" style="text-decoration:none;"><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:32px;color:#003B7A;">GATOR</span><span class="gb-wordmark" style="font-size:32px;color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span></a><br/>
          <span style="font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:3px;color:#003B7A;">MEDIA</span>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_6908ebe20dff4857b7274b5a1ed6598e~mv2.jpg" alt="Jon Sumrall: It ain't fully awake yet. Florida 52, No. 4 Ole Miss 28." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/sumrall-postgame-press-conference-ole-miss-not-fully-awake?utm_source=gatorbait_postgame_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_reaction_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=presser_image" padding="0" width="640px" />
        <mj-text align="right" color="#AEBBD0" font-size="11px" padding="6px 14px 8px">Photos by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="26px 30px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" font-size="11px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="2px" color="#D8450C">THE PRESS CONFERENCE</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 14px" color="#081B35"><span class="gb-h1">Sumrall: &ldquo;It ain&rsquo;t fully awake yet&rdquo;</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px">Jon Sumrall barely had a voice left after beating No. 4 Ole Miss, and he used it to say the Gators have not arrived.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px">&ldquo;We have so much room to grow and get better,&rdquo; he said. Asked whether the beast he talked about waking is stirring: &ldquo;It ain&rsquo;t fully awake yet. &hellip; I promise you, I didn&rsquo;t come here for us to be average.&rdquo;</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px">Jadan Baugh said the Gators left points on the board, Sumrall explained the broken headset on Duke Clark&rsquo;s 45-yard touchdown, and he had injury updates on Bailey Stockton and Vernell Brown III.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/sumrall-postgame-press-conference-ole-miss-not-fully-awake?utm_source=gatorbait_postgame_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_reaction_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=presser_cta" align="left" padding="6px 0 24px">WHAT SUMRALL AND THE GATORS SAID</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d3cfa5_043359d3e2df42e9b904bb3bfd521384~mv2.jpg" alt="Column by Carlton Reese: Contenders, not hopefuls." href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/carlton-reese-florida-contenders-not-hopefuls-ole-miss?utm_source=gatorbait_postgame_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_reaction_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=column_image" padding="0" width="640px" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="24px 30px 6px">
      <mj-column border-left="5px solid #FA4616" padding="4px 0 4px 16px">
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" font-size="12px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="1.5px" color="#D8450C">COLUMN &middot; CARLTON REESE</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 10px" color="#081B35"><span class="gb-h2">Contenders, not hopefuls</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 16px">&ldquo;This is no longer a Florida team simply hoping to improve and be more competitive. This team is a legitimate contender for championships.&rdquo;</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/carlton-reese-florida-contenders-not-hopefuls-ole-miss?utm_source=gatorbait_postgame_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_reaction_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=column_cta" align="left" padding="0 0 20px">READ CARLTON&rsquo;S COLUMN</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#081B35" padding="22px 30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text color="#FA7A45" font-size="11px" font-weight="900" letter-spacing="2px" padding="0 0 6px">NEXT</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="19px" line-height="1.35" font-weight="800" padding="0 0 6px">Florida (4-0) at Missouri</mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#D5DFEC" font-size="15px" line-height="1.5" padding="0 0 14px">Saturday, Oct. 3, 3:30 p.m. ET. The full game story, By the Numbers and Chris Spears&rsquo; photos are on the site.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/florida-ole-miss-final-baugh-gators-run-over-rebels?utm_source=gatorbait_postgame_email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=postgame_reaction_ole_miss_2026_09_26&utm_content=game_story" align="left" padding="0" background-color="#FFFFFF" color="#081B35">READ THE GAME STORY</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="18px 26px 22px">
      <mj-column width="40%">
        <mj-text padding="0" color="#003B7A" font-size="18px" font-weight="900">GATOR<span style="color:#FA4616;">BAIT</span> MEDIA</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="60%">
        <mj-text align="right" color="#667386" font-size="11px" line-height="1.55" padding="0">Florida football. All the time.<br/>GatorBaitMedia.com &middot; Old-school journalism + new tech.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
